     "updated": "2012-02-10T18:43:26.552-0400"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a4e8b233c8006ba9915a",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a27b189f53110c93b66a08557fa79dee?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FRK-0.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a27b189f53110c93b66a08557fa79dee?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FRK-0.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a27b189f53110c93b66a08557fa79dee?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FRK-0.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a27b189f53110c93b66a08557fa79dee?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FRK-0.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Rebecca Sutton Koeser",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4e8b233c8006ba9915a",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I've been thinking about this problem some more, and wondered if it would make more sense to create a stand-alone script (something that could be made available independent of a full-blown release of Fedora) that could selectively clean up or canonicalize the xml to make it match existing checksums.  Obviously, something like this would need a lot of testing and checks, since it will have to bypass the Fedora APIs (entirely? partially?).  ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Since fixing this is a current need for our production repository, it's possible I or someone on my team could write a python script to do this repository clean-up, if we knew what exactly should be done (whether and how to reformat/re-canonicalize the xml, or update the checksums), along with any other recommendations from the Fedora developers (approach, safeguards, etc).",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
